+Each tracker has a `description` template (default `{overview}\n\n{images}`, i.e. the previous behaviour). Variables
+(`{tmdb_title}`, `{file_size}`, `{torrent_infohash}`, `{tmdb.<any TMDB field>}`, ...) are registered in `src/variables.py`;
+add one with a decorated function and it is available everywhere, including the web UI's variable list.
